# =============================================================================
# NERVE — Environment Variables
# =============================================================================
#
# PUBLIC vs SECRET:
# - Anything prefixed VITE_ is bundled into the browser JS and visible to anyone.
#   ⚠️ NEVER put secrets there. Use placeholders or real values only in Vercel.
#
# - Server secrets (no VITE_ prefix) are set via:
#   $ supabase secrets set KEY=value
#   and are only accessible inside Edge Functions.
#
# See PRODUCTION_READINESS.md and SETUP.md for full documentation.
# =============================================================================

# ── Frontend (Vite) — PUBLIC, bundled to browser ──────────────────────────────
# REQUIRED for both dev and production
# Set in Vercel: Settings → Environment Variables (Production + Preview)

# Supabase — Database & Auth
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR_PROJECT_REF.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=YOUR_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY

# App Configuration
VITE_ENV=development
VITE_APP_URL=https://www.nerveey.shop
VITE_SUPPORT_EMAIL=support@nerveey.shop

# ── Observability (Frontend) — PUBLIC ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Safe to expose. Omit if not used. Set real values in Vercel (not in repo).

# Sentry — Error tracking
# Create project: https://sentry.io → Copy DSN
# ⚠️ DO NOT commit real DSN to repo
# VITE_SENTRY_DSN=https://PLACEHOLDER@o123456.ingest.sentry.io/123456

# Google Analytics 4 — Traffic analytics
# Get ID from: https://analytics.google.com → Admin → Data Streams → Measurement ID
# ⚠️ DO NOT commit real ID to repo
# VITE_GA_ID=G-XXXXXXXXXX

# Meta Pixel — Facebook/Instagram conversion tracking
# Get ID from: https://business.facebook.com → Events Manager → Pixels → Pixel ID
# ⚠️ DO NOT commit real ID to repo
# VITE_META_PIXEL_ID=XXXXXXXXXXXXXXX

# ── Optional Integrations (Frontend) ──────────────────────────────────────────

# Crisp Chat — Live chat widget
# Sign up: https://crisp.chat → Dashboard → Settings → Website ID
# VITE_CRISP_ID=YOUR_CRISP_WEBSITE_ID

# Snapchat Lens — AR Try-On feature
# Create Lens: Snap AR Studio → Deploy → Lens ID
# VITE_SNAPCHAT_LENS_ID=YOUR_LENS_ID

# ── Backend Secrets — SERVER ONLY, NEVER VITE_ ────────────────────────────────
# Set via: supabase secrets set KEY=value
# List:    supabase secrets list
# These are injected as Deno.env.get('KEY') inside Edge Functions only.
# DO NOT add real values here. Manage in Supabase dashboard only.

# Gemini AI — Chatbot & content generation
# Get API key: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# Set in Supabase: supabase secrets set GOOGLE_GEMINI_API_KEY=sk_...
# Alias: OPENAI_API_KEY also accepted (not recommended)

# Resend — Transactional emails (orders, support, back-in-stock, abandoned cart)
# Get API key: https://resend.com/api-keys
# Set in Supabase: supabase secrets set RESEND_API_KEY=re_...
# Also set: RESEND_FROM_EMAIL and STORE_URL

# Paymob — Online card payments (optional, P1 feature)
# Get keys: https://accept.paymob.com → API Keys
# Set in Supabase:
#   supabase secrets set PAYMOB_API_KEY=...
#   supabase secrets set PAYMOB_HMAC_SECRET=...
#   supabase secrets set PAYMOB_IFRAME_ID=...
#   supabase secrets set PAYMOB_INTEGRATION_ID=...

# Cron — Scheduled jobs protection (optional)
# Generate random 32-char secret, then:
#   supabase secrets set CRON_SECRET=...
# Scheduler edge functions require this header: x-cron-secret

# ── Auto-Injected by Supabase (DO NOT SET) ────────────────────────────────────
# These are automatically available inside Edge Functions:
# - SUPABASE_URL (service role URL for database access)
# - SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY (service role key for DB access)
# Do NOT set these yourself — Supabase injects them automatically.
